Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dragon Balls.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.55,0:00:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}When seven of these\Nmysterious balls are gathered{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.01,0:00:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and the password recited,\Na dragon called Shenron appears.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shenron will grant\Nwhatever wish is requested.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.99,0:00:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This man, Son Goku, may appear gentle,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.03,0:00:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}but he is of a battle race called Saiyans,\Nand possesses unparalleled strength.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}As a child, he lived in the mountains,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and through his search for\Nthe Dragon Balls, met many friends{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and grew into adults with them.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Saiyans maintain youthful bodies\Nfor most of their lives.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.93,0:01:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even now, together with his former rivals,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}he continues to protect Earth\Nfrom the clutches of evil.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Original Work, Story & Character Design\NAkira Toriyama (Shueisha "Jump comics")
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.54,0:01:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hee, hee hee!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Time to adventure!\NYou'll be hooked for sure!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Demon Realm is full of mystery{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}DAIMA wonderland{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.55,0:01:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Whoopsie daisy!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even when your heart shrinks\NAnd you feel low{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.85,0:01:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dreams are everywhere\NDon't worry about it{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Never give up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.86,0:02:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Here comes a New Story{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.07,0:02:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Thousands of jabs and silly jokes{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.33,0:02:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They're waitin' for you{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Jaan! Jaka jaan!\NThe fanfare of courage{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.67,0:02:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No-holds-barred battles\NThe excitement ain't stoppin'{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey Shenron, grant my wish{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wanna meet\NSomeone amazin' again tomorrow{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:45.45,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,PANZY
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you so strong\Neven though you're a kid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Because I trained, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.59,0:03:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Trainin' is trainin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh well. You saved me back there. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Your ears are round!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What race are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.27,0:03:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a Saiyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,From what Demon World?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:16.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:22.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That said, you certainly are courageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.03,0:03:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though you messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.03,0:03:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh shut up!\NThe gunpowder of my Wasabi Bomb was damp!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forget her. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.13,0:03:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-Shhhh!\N-Oh! Whoops!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You mean Kadan Castle? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. We're in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.09,0:03:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.39,0:03:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.60,0:03:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're pretty gloomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.73,0:03:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Let's go together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know how to get to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,B-Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who was that brat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Where did that brat go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We've lost him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Track his Collar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was all so sudden that\Nwe couldn't confirm his Collar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a spikey-haired kid with a red stick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man. I missed out on lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.69,0:04:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.15,0:04:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna eat a rice ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.86,0:04:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-Here.\N-Really?! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Panzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Panzy? That's a weird name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.50,0:04:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then what's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.75,0:05:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your name's much weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My other name's Kakarot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have two names? They both sound weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.97,0:05:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What magic are you good at?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Every Majin can use\Nat least one magic spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Magic, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.65,0:05:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can touch my nose with my tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.95,0:05:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you're sayin' you can use magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! That's amazin', Panzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:06:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, my specialty is actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.48,0:06:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,tinkering with machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah. It's Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you a Glind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.79,0:06:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it. Gomah's second in command,\Nthat Degesu guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}He's a Glind, and he's kind of like you.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.13,0:06:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.55,0:06:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that most of the Glinds\Nleft to the outside world a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but I guess there's still\Nchildren like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what's a Glind kid like you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just journeying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.85,0:06:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Journeying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm. Something's fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hardly anyone comes to the\NThird Demon World aside from on business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough questions. If you\Nwant conversation, go pester someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I ask your name, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Goliro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.71,0:07:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No. It's Glorio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,G… Go… Golori…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.01,0:07:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Glorio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.47,0:07:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cutting through those rocks is faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! She says it's this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.28,0:07:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know, Gomah's Gendarmerie\Nwere quite cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Draining life just because\Npeople can't pay gold coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's crazy, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.74,0:07:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you can't pay a single coin,\Nthey drain nine whole years of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dabura was pretty bad,\Nbut even he was better than Gomah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The average lifespan here\Nis only 1,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.51,0:07:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1,000 years?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that more than enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm 82.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.43,0:08:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! You're older than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The route gets rougher from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's Kadan Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For a castle,\Nit don't look that impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's rude. For the Third Demon World\Nit's pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the king like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Think of him as an uncivilized mafia boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he's not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He only steals from criminals\Nand only kills bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hear what he has to say\Nand borrow a plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!\NWe need to hurry and rescue Dende!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.03,0:08:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Cerberus then spoke."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:09:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"'Red ogre, red ogre,\Ncould you please spare one or two,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,no, 100 of those meatballs?'"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-Hey!\N-"The red ogre…"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,K-King Gomah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You call that reading?\NUse more emotion and make it fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sire. Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's an important Namek who's eventually\Ngoing to make new Dragon Balls for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.27,0:09:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take good care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.77,0:09:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"'Red ogre, red ogre!'"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.19,0:09:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"'Could you please spare one or two, no…'"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this Kadan Castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Girl, this is far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Suit yourself. You'll only be turned away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.59,0:09:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck do you want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:10:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Glorio. We met yesterday, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need to speak with King Kadan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And who are these brats?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's a brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.69,0:10:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! P-Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.11,0:10:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's that attitude that makes people\Ncall this place a mafia's castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They do? Who says that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.58,0:10:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.75,0:10:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-Hi.\N-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're the princess of this castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You could have told us that sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you don't really seem like a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh be quiet, Goku! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are all Demon World castles like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like there's anything special.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's nobody really scary here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Every place is like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.75,0:11:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.71,0:11:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Guests for Dad. Let them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Glorio is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At last!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You… Didn't you say you'd bring someone\Npowerful enough to defeat Majin Buu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These two are them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're just little brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.56,0:12:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not as powerful as Goku-san here.\NI'm just accompanying him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I saw him take out the Gendarmerie.\NHe's really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.03,0:12:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. He rescued me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.45,0:12:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you have my thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.75,0:12:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I see you helped Panzy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you asked that\Nthey bring Goku here, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No. This Glorio fellow told me he could\Nfetch someone who could defeat Gomah
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.89,0:12:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,from the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.31,0:12:54.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys are from the outside world?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought something was weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.48,0:12:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that's why your ears are round!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.24,0:13:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How come people from\Nthe outside world are so strong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plus you can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you. Because I trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you requested that Gomah be defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. He can't be allowed to run free.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.25,0:13:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gomah's a villain\Nwho shouldn't be Supreme Demon King!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Once he's defeated,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll become Supreme Demon King\Nfor the peace of the Demon Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If things go as planned,\Nyou can marry Panzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.89,0:13:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not your decision to make, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't mean now.\NI meant after you grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I'm already married and I've got kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.83,0:13:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're an adult?!\NDoes your race look like children?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku-san and I were\Nturned into children by Gomah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To return to normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,we need to rescue our Namek friend Dende,\Nwho Gomah kidnapped,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,or gather the Demon Realm Dragon Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.48,0:14:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Dragon Balls?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.90,0:14:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you planning to fight the Tamagamis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.90,0:14:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Holy moly…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.95,0:14:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You were planning\Nsomething that ridiculous?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.53,0:14:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If there's only three, it should be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.45,0:14:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No one has ever gathered\Nall three Demon Realm Dragon Balls before!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Tamagamis are so strong that\Neven Gomah couldn't gather them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it'll work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.05,0:14:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Wait, if it's true that\Nthey actually defeated Majin Buu…{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.31,0:14:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}they might actually succeed.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the situation.\NIf you've got a plane could we borrow it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ours was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, before that…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.61,0:15:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I still can't believe that\Nyou're that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could you give us a demonstration?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.50,0:15:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen up, you lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku-san here may be small, but\Nhe's the strongest warrior in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.76,0:15:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you all fight him and win,\Nyou'll get a raise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.56,0:15:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They appear to be fairly\Nseasoned warriors for this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.56,0:15:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not in your prime,\Nbut is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine. It'll be good trainin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen up! No holding back, you hear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But no killing! Leave your weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:15:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.41,0:15:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need the trainin', but no guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,T-Training?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You cocky little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll regret this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.55,0:16:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whenever you're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-He's strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.51,0:16:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grab his arms and legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.46,0:17:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.84,0:17:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Apologies.\NThis is the best plane I can offer you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all. It'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That said, I'll provide you with water,\Nliquor, food, weapons, and sleeping bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.36,0:17:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you finished rewriting the data?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:17:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure thing, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean by rewriting?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not the same plane\Nas the one Glorio registered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Warp-sama won't let you through with\Nthe same pin number anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So we just fiddled with the data a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.51,0:18:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In a few days, our friends should be\Nshowing up to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.22,0:18:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But they don't know the pin number.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There isn't much I can do\Nif they don't have a pin number.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.27,0:18:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.15,0:18:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Hybis!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.86,0:18:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.11,0:18:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ballet lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go to the outside world\Nand fetch the friends of our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Right now? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.\NI'm sure no one will be wary of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:19:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was about to go to the beauty parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Save that for later!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine. Where in the outside world?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To a planet called Earth in Universe 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.06,0:19:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's at a temple\Nthat floats in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A Majin going to a temple…\NThat's a bit of a tall order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.49,0:19:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-Hmm…\N-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's far.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:29.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How many people am I fetching?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.16,0:19:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Three or four, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll need a mid-sized plane,\Nbut all we have left are small ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.59,0:19:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right. I'll get you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.88,0:19:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yessir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go to the Nemophy Gang\Nand steal a mid-sized plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yessir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It might take a bit,\Nbut will you wait for your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.89,0:19:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They can catch up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.61,0:19:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Panzy? What's that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll only get in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna see Gomah go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plus I'm good with machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got my secret weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And if this trash plane breaks,\Nthey'll be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.25,0:20:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,B-But…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gliro, are you good with machines?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Glorio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Machines aren't my forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.39,0:20:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then Panzy comin' with us'll\Nbe a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.81,0:20:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku, now you're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.73,0:20:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.\NIf things get hairy, I'll protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.16,0:20:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.54,0:20:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.34,0:21:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goku-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems that Glorio-san\Nis definitely hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,King Kadan didn't know\Nwe'd been turned into children.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And Glorio-san said he was\N"requested by the king,"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but it looks like he's the one\Nwho approached the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.23,0:21:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.44,0:21:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, does it really matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.07,0:21:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry on board and let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.99,0:21:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.83,0:21:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's too much luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.37,0:21:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful out there, Panzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.08,0:21:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! We're off now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.17,0:21:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.89,0:21:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it a long way to the Dragon Ball\Nof this Demon World?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.69,0:22:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With breaks, it should take us\Nabout four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.31,0:22:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.23,0:22:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna just sit around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.28,0:22:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Third Demon World is\Nthe biggest in the Demon Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.16,0:22:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop whining. It's only four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.66,0:22:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.41,0:22:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.63,0:22:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The engine sounds bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.75,0:22:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think we loaded\Ntoo much luggage for this plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Holding out my hand{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.44,0:22:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Up to the sky{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.24,0:22:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The moment is ours{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.41,0:22:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Make a miracle happen{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.91,0:23:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Like a bird with open wings we fly{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.17,0:23:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Picking up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.01,0:23:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Those pieces of hope{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.34,0:23:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There's no giving up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.85,0:23:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Go as far as we can{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.19,0:23:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I got you by my side{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.82,0:23:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Run, run, run{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.90,0:23:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Over the mountain we go{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.49,0:23:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I hear it always\NYour voice in my heart{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"You know that we're never alone"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.71,0:23:45.59,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,LIGHTNING
